flowchart TD
  accTitle: Classes
  accDescr: Each drawn class set inline and by a class line; classDef is ignored.
  %% a comment line is skipped
  classDef accent fill:#E6F4F2,stroke:#0B8F80
  classDef loud fill:#f00
  A[Inline accent]:::accent --> B[inline cmd]:::cmd --> C[Inline muted]:::muted
  D[Accent by line] --> E[cmd by line] --> F[Muted by line]
  G[Two classes]:::muted --> F
  class D,G accent
  class E cmd
  class F muted;
